---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+13015550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(301) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Deck Railing Repair Gaithersburg MD | Posts & Balusters" description="Secure loose posts, replace broken balusters, and bring railings up to safe, code-conscious standards.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Railing & Baluster Repair in Gaithersburg, MD</h1>
      <p>Secure loose posts, replace broken balusters, and bring railings up to safe, code-conscious standards.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:1.25rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Get a Quote — {phoneDisplay}</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-page">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prose">
<h2>Safe, Solid Railings</h2>
<p>A railing that moves when leaned on is a serious safety issue. We reinforce or replace posts, install new balusters, and ensure the finished assembly feels solid and meets modern height expectations.</p>
<ul>
<li>Post base reinforcement and replacement</li>
<li>Baluster and picket replacement</li>
<li>Handrail repairs</li>
<li>Wood, composite, and metal systems</li>
</ul>
        <p style="margin-top:2rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Schedule Railing & Baluster Repair in Gaithersburg, MD</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
